  "description": "*How did I end up in the same bed as the biggest top star of our time…?!*\n\nSeongha now runs a café out on the outskirts, a so-called “washed-up celebrity.” After a certain incident in the past, the idol group he once led disbanded, and he retired from the entertainment industry in disgrace, becoming a forgotten star. But somehow, he finds himself working on the same project as Jaehyeon—the nation’s beloved top star?! No, not just the same project… but the same bed as well…?!\n\n**Original Webtoon (R19):**  \nR19: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/297020207), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/dw_1142), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=3400054), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/sign_on_me), Bookcube ([1](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=200023), [2](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=920001318))  \nR15: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/297031846), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000055803), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/home/53994143)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR15: [S.Chinese](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc28553)",
